      "updated_at": "2025-12-09T21:20:14Z",
      "body": "So actually we have two issues:\n\n- On some OpenSSL versions it seems that `OBJ_nid2obj` may return NULL without an error indicator set (which is a bit weird though but I guess I can also remove the assertion, it could have been a too strict guard).\n- The copy is lacking the NID because I forgot to copy the field as well...",
